page('/learning-path/','Follow the Kiddo.school learning path: forty age-guided classes from birth to age 5','Follow the Kiddo.school learning path: forty age-guided classes from birth to age 5, each a short parent-led session, plus classrooms for older children. Start where your child is today.',crumb([['Learning Path']])+heading('THE LEARNING PATH','Where do we start? What comes next?','Forty classes are ready now, from birth to age five, in one calm sequence. Each class takes two to five playful minutes and is led by you. Age ranges are a guide, not a test — start where your child is and follow their cues.')+`<section class="wrap section compact"><div class="lp-path">${stages.map((s,i)=>`<div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>${String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">${s.name}</span><span class="fc-class">${s.age}</span></div><h2>${s.name}: ${s.age}</h2><p class="lp-class">Class ${i+1}: <a href="${s.lesson.path}">${s.lesson.h1}</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="${s.href}">${s.name}</a>${fcLinkFor(s.lesson)}${wsLinkFor(s.lesson)}</p></div></div>`).join('')}<div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>15</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3</span></div><h2>Preschool: Alphabet &amp; Letter Sounds</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 15: <a href="/preschool/3-years/alphabet-and-letter-sounds/">Alphabet &amp; Letter Sounds</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/3-years/">Age 3</a> — the <a href="/flashcards/alphabet/">Alphabet A–Z</a> cards print from here.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>16</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3</span></div><h2>Preschool: Numbers &amp; Counting</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 16: <a href="/preschool/3-years/numbers-and-counting/">Numbers &amp; Counting (1–10)</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/3-years/">Age 3</a> · Counting cards for <a href="/flashcards/numbers-and-counting/">Numbers 1–10</a>, ready to download.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>17</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3</span></div><h2>Preschool: Shapes &amp; Patterns</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 17: <a href="/preschool/3-years/shapes-and-patterns/">Shapes &amp; Patterns</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/3-years/">Age 3</a> · The <a href="/flashcards/shapes/">Shapes</a> card set pairs with this class.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>18</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3</span></div><h2>Preschool: Colors &amp; Color Mixing</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 18: <a href="/preschool/3-years/colors-and-color-mixing/">Colors &amp; Color Mixing</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/3-years/">Age 3</a> · Print the <a href="/flashcards/colors/">Colors</a> cards to use during the class.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>19</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3</span></div><h2>Preschool: Opposites &amp; Comparing</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 19: <a href="/preschool/3-years/opposites-and-comparing/">Opposites &amp; Comparing</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/3-years/">Age 3</a> · A printable <a href="/flashcards/opposites/">Opposites</a> set sits behind this class.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>20</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3</span></div><h2>Preschool: Animals &amp; Their Sounds</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 20: <a href="/preschool/3-years/animals-and-their-sounds/">Animals &amp; Their Sounds</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/3-years/">Age 3</a> · The <a href="/flashcards/animal-sounds/">Animals &amp; Their Sounds</a> cards are one click away.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>21</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3</span></div><h2>Preschool: Body Parts &amp; My Five Senses</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 21: <a href="/preschool/3-years/body-parts-and-five-senses/">Body Parts &amp; My Five Senses</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/3-years/">Age 3</a> · <a href="/flashcards/body-parts-and-five-senses/">Body Parts &amp; Five Senses</a> cards support every lesson.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>22</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3</span></div><h2>Preschool: Fruits &amp; Vegetables</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 22: <a href="/preschool/3-years/fruits-and-vegetables/">Fruits &amp; Vegetables</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/3-years/">Age 3</a> · Grab the <a href="/flashcards/fruits-and-vegetables/">Fruits &amp; Vegetables</a> cards before you start.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>23</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 3–5</span></div><h2>The Music Room — Instruments, Music Words &amp; Music-Makers</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 23: <a href="/music-room/">The Music Room</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/music-room/">the Music Room</a> · Thirty-three instruments, thirteen music words and the seven people who make music together — all fifty-three cards print from the <a href="/flashcards/music-room/">Music Room flashcards</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>24</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Transportation &amp; Vehicles</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 24: <a href="/preschool/4-years/transportation-and-vehicles/">Transportation &amp; Vehicles</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Thirty-two spotter lessons open with the <a href="/preschool/4-years/transportation-and-vehicles/learn/land-01/">Car, Bus, Train &amp; Bicycle</a> card — land, water, air and eleven construction sheets, four labeled vehicles per card — and the <a href="/flashcards/transportation-and-vehicles/">printable vehicles cards</a> carry the whole transport theme home.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>25</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 4</span></div><h2>Preschool: Shapes, Patterns &amp; Sorting</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 25: <a href="/preschool/4-years/shapes-patterns-and-sorting/">Shapes, Patterns &amp; Sorting</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · This class runs on the <a href="/worksheets/shapes/">shape printables</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>26</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 4</span></div><h2>Preschool: Colors, Mixing &amp; Creativity</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 26: <a href="/preschool/4-years/colors-mixing-and-creativity/">Colors, Mixing &amp; Creativity</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · The <a href="/worksheets/colors/">color printables</a> are this class’s practice shelf.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>27</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 4</span></div><h2>Preschool: Early Writing &amp; Pencil Control</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 27: <a href="/preschool/4-years/early-writing-and-pencil-control/">Early Writing &amp; Pencil Control</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Pencil practice lives in the <a href="/worksheets/writing/">writing printables</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>28</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Phonics &amp; Beginning Sounds</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 28: <a href="/preschool/4-years/phonics-and-beginning-sounds/">Phonics &amp; Beginning Sounds</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Twenty-six letter-sound lessons open with the <a href="/preschool/4-years/phonics-and-beginning-sounds/learn/a-apple/">Apple</a> card — Aa apple to Zz zebra, each with its own sound script — the whole alphabet prints from the <a href="/flashcards/phonics-and-beginning-sounds/">A–Z letter-sound cards</a>, and sounds get drilled on the <a href="/worksheets/phonics/">phonics printables</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>29</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Storytime &amp; Pre-Reading Comprehension</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 29: <a href="/preschool/4-years/storytime-and-pre-reading/">Storytime &amp; Pre-Reading Comprehension</a> · <a href="/preschool/4-years/sight-words/">Sight Words</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Fifty-two sight word lessons from <a href="/preschool/4-years/sight-words/a/">A</a> onward — each with a drawing canvas, how to say the word and where to use it — plus the <a href="/flashcards/sight-words/">printable sight word cards</a>, and story talk continues on the <a href="/worksheets/reading/">reading printables</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>30</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Logic, Thinking &amp; Problem-Solving</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 30: <a href="/preschool/4-years/logic-thinking-and-problem-solving/">Logic, Thinking &amp; Problem-Solving</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Thinking games continue on the <a href="/worksheets/logic/">logic printables</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>31</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Science, Nature &amp; Discovery</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 31: <a href="/preschool/4-years/science-nature-and-discovery/">Science, Nature &amp; Discovery</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Print the <a href="/flashcards/science-nature-and-discovery/">science flashcards</a>, or start straight on the <a href="/worksheets/science/">science worksheets</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>32</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Life Skills &amp; Good Habits</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 32: <a href="/preschool/4-years/life-skills-and-good-habits/">Life Skills &amp; Good Habits</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · <a href="/flashcards/life-skills-and-good-habits/">Habit cards</a> to print and <a href="/worksheets/life-skills/">practice sheets</a> to try, beginning with <a href="/preschool/life-skills/wash-your-hands/">Wash Your Hands</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>33</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Community Helpers &amp; Our Neighborhood</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 33: <a href="/preschool/4-years/community-helpers-and-our-neighborhood/">Community Helpers &amp; Our Neighborhood</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Twenty-nine helper lessons from <a href="/preschool/4-years/community-helpers-and-our-neighborhood/learn/doctor/">Doctor</a> onward, plus the <a href="/flashcards/community-helpers-and-our-neighborhood/">printable helper cards</a> and <a href="/preschool/4-years/community-helpers-and-our-neighborhood/worksheets/doctor/">35 worksheets</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>34</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Weather, Seasons &amp; What We Wear</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 34: <a href="/preschool/4-years/weather-seasons-and-what-we-wear/">Weather, Seasons &amp; What We Wear</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Weather lessons open with the <a href="/preschool/4-years/weather-seasons-and-what-we-wear/learn/sun/">Sun</a>, the <a href="/flashcards/weather-seasons-and-what-we-wear/">weather cards</a> print alongside, and <a href="/worksheets/weather-seasons-and-what-we-wear/">35 weather worksheets</a> — water cycle, maps, forecasts, storm safety — round off the practice shelf.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>35</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Numbers, Counting &amp; Early Math</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 35: <a href="/preschool/4-years/numbers-counting-and-early-math/">Numbers, Counting &amp; Early Math</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Twenty counting lessons open with the <a href="/preschool/4-years/numbers-counting-and-early-math/learn/one-apple/">One Apple</a> card — one apple to twenty figs — and the <a href="/flashcards/numbers-counting-and-early-math/">printable cards</a> deal across the floor as a number line.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>36</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Animals &amp; Their Habitats</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 36: <a href="/preschool/4-years/animals-and-their-habitats/">Animals &amp; Their Habitats</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Twenty-two habitat lessons open with the <a href="/preschool/4-years/animals-and-their-habitats/learn/rabbit-meadow/">Rabbit</a> — meadow to pond to forest, desert, ocean and ice — the <a href="/flashcards/animals-and-their-habitats/">printable habitat cards</a> sort by home across the floor, and the <a href="/worksheets/animals-and-their-habitats/">6 habitat worksheets</a> — circle, match, count and trace — round off the practice shelf.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>37</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Sports, Movement &amp; Play</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 37: <a href="/preschool/4-years/sports-movement-and-play/">Sports, Movement &amp; Play</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Forty movement lessons open with the <a href="/preschool/4-years/sports-movement-and-play/learn/soccer/">Soccer</a> card — ball games to athletics, water to wheels, martial arts to the mighty lift — each teaching one big move step by step, and the <a href="/flashcards/sports/">printable sports cards</a> carry every skill home.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>38</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Feelings &amp; Kindness</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 38: <a href="/preschool/4-years/feelings-and-kindness/">Feelings &amp; Kindness</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">Stage hub: <a href="/preschool/4-years/">Age 4</a> · Thirty-five feelings-and-kindness lessons open with the <a href="/preschool/4-years/feelings-and-kindness/learn/happy/">Happy, Sad, Angry &amp; Calm</a> card — feeling faces, kind words, calm-down skills and belonging words, four a card, to the kindness graduation — and the <a href="/flashcards/feelings-and-kindness/">printable feelings cards</a> carry every word home.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>39</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Staying Safe</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 39: <a href="/staying-safe/">Staying Safe</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">The whole class lives at <a href="/staying-safe/">Staying Safe</a> — nineteen safety cards from buckle-up to the stop-drop-roll drill, one short page per card with the rule and one way to practise it today — and the <a href="/first-glance/">First Glance</a> safety sheet holds the same words for the youngest eyes.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>40</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 4–5</span></div><h2>Preschool: Healthy Food &amp; Eating Well</h2><p class="lp-class">Class 40: <a href="/healthy-food/">Healthy Food &amp; Eating Well</a></p><p class="lp-hublink">The whole class lives at <a href="/healthy-food/">Healthy Food &amp; Eating Well</a> — twenty-one food-habit cards in three shelves (the plate, the meals, the table habits), one short page per card with one thing to try at tonight’s table — and the <a href="/cafeteria/">Cafeteria room</a> keeps sixty-two food cards to name beside it.</p></div></div>${extraClassesLpRow()}<div class="lp-row"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>+</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card lp-next"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Growing up</span><span class="fc-class">Ages 3–12</span></div><h2>Classrooms for older children</h2><p>Beyond the early years, the school opens into hands-on classrooms: <a href="/art/">Art Studio</a>, <a href="/science/">Science Lab</a>, <a href="/nature/">Nature Club</a>, <a href="/maths/">Maths Room</a>, <a href="/literacy/">Story Corner</a> and <a href="/engineering/">Build &amp; Tinker</a>, plus <a href="/clubs/">the Clubs</a> — forty-five after-school activities from art to coding — and <a href="/activities/">all activities by age</a>.</p></div></div><div class="lp-row lp-magic"><div class="lp-marker" aria-hidden="true"><span>+</span></div><div class="lp-stage-card"><div class="fc-stage-pills"><span class="fc-age">Preschool</span><span class="fc-class">Age 3 magic games</span></div><h2>The magic games — a separate shelf for playful practice</h2><p class="lp-class">Play: <a href="/preschool/3-years/magic-shape-builder/">Look &amp; Draw — Magic Shapes</a> (Class 3) · <a href="/preschool/3-years/magic-animal-playground/">Animal Sound Safari</a> (Class 6)</p><p class="lp-hublink">Two gentle interactive games with no scores and no timers — each one is wired to its Age 3 class and lives on its own shelf, outside the class sequence.</p></div></div></div><p class="lesson-note"><strong>Age ranges are a guide, not a test.</strong> Children learn at their own pace. Explore in any order that suits your family, and stop whenever your child has had enough.</p></section><section class="wrap lesson-section"><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href="/newborn/0-6-weeks/high-contrast-cards/">Start Today’s Class <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="button button-ghost" href="/grown-ups/">Guidance for grown-ups <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div></section><section class="wrap lesson-section"><div class="brand-duo"><div class="brand-copy"><span class="eyebrow">EVERY CLASS COUNTS</span><h2>Little celebrations along the way.</h2><p class="lesson-copy">A finished class is a real thing: a game played to its celebration, a worksheet on the fridge, a book read twice. The path is long and growing — every small step on it deserves its moment.</p></div><div class="brand-art brand-art-pair"><img src="${brandBase}kiddo-achievement-star-certificate.webp" width="1264" height="1264" alt="A boy holds a big golden star and a girl holds a certificate, both in purple school uniforms, from the Kiddo.school achievement illustration." loading="lazy"><img src="${brandBase}kiddo-achievement-star-trophy.webp" width="1264" height="1264" alt="A girl holds a golden star and a boy holds a trophy, both in purple school uniforms, from the Kiddo.school trophy illustration." loading="lazy"></div></div></section>`,{ogImage:brandBase+'kiddo-achievement-star-certificate.webp',ogW:1264,ogH:1264,ogAlt:'A boy holds a big golden star and a girl holds a certificate, both in purple school uniforms — the Kiddo.school achievement illustration.'});

